 polynomial: `cs[k]` is the coefficient of `A^(lo+k)`.\nNormalised — no leading/trailing zero coeffs; the zero polynomial is\n`⟨0, []⟩` — so structural `DecidableEq` is equality of polynomials. ","signatureChunk":0}]}